PREFIX px: <urn:pxai:semi:> CONSTRUCT { ?workflow px:enablesRCAFor ?anomaly . } WHERE { ?workflow a px:RCAEvidenceIntegrationPattern . ?workflow px:integratesEvidenceFrom ?source . ?source a px:SourceArtifact . ?workflow px:diagnosesAnomaly ?anomaly . ?anomaly a px:QualityExcursionAnomaly . FILTER(CONTAINS(LCASE(STR(?source)), "sixsense") || CONTAINS(LCASE(STR(?source)), "telemetry")) }
